=== plain-80: width 80, height 24, profile notty, dark, glyphs ascii, plain
  keys refused -------------------------------------------------$
$
# Note$
# Proposed: no Figma frame. sshd asks RequiredRSASize 3072 and$
# takes no ECDSA key: george's RSA 2048 key and alice's ECDSA$
# key can't log in. Neither is weak.$
$
# SSH Keys #####################################################$
$
  Summary ------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  Keys                 3 in 2 accounts$
   -  Refused by sshd      2 keys$
$
  george -------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  RSA 2048             george@desk-1 Refused by sshd$
   -  ED25519              george@laptop-1$
$
  alice --------------------------------------------------------$
$
   -  ECDSA 256            alice@laptop-2 Refused by sshd$
$
   0) Return$
$
    > Option [0 or q]:$
$
$

